1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,814
Five lake-style pools, a free water park, and a white-sand Caribbean beach: welcome to Bahia Principe Explore Punta Cana.

2
00:00:08,864 --> 00:00:20,041
You may know it as Grand Bahia Principe Punta Cana, but it has a new name, it belongs to the Hyatt Inclusive Collection, and Expedia lists it as renovated twenty twenty-six.

3
00:00:20,091 --> 00:00:27,154
Here is why it is a smart pick for friends and families who want a big, lively, all-inclusive week.

4
00:00:27,205 --> 00:00:28,510
Start with the water.

5
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:34,671
Five outdoor pools spread through the tropical gardens, with a waterslide and two swim-up bars.

6
00:00:34,721 --> 00:00:38,874
Guests praised the clean, spacious pools in seventy-nine reviews.

7
00:00:38,924 --> 00:00:46,392
The beach is right next door, about five hundred meters of soft white sand, with umbrellas and beach volleyball.

8
00:00:46,442 --> 00:00:50,169
And the Bahia Scouts Water Park is free for guests.

9
00:00:50,219 --> 00:00:51,496
Now, the room.

10
00:00:51,546 --> 00:00:57,628
All one thousand four hundred twenty-eight rooms have a balcony and a separate sitting area.

11
00:00:57,678 --> 00:01:03,278
Bathrooms come with rainfall showers, and Expedia lists jetted tubs.

12
00:01:03,328 --> 00:01:10,024
Wi-Fi is free in the room, parking is free, and there is even an electric car charging station.

13
00:01:10,075 --> 00:01:11,324
Now, the food.

14
00:01:11,374 --> 00:01:17,805
There are seven restaurants on site, and a free breakfast buffet to start every day.

15
00:01:17,855 --> 00:01:23,043
Expect buffets, Mongolian cuisine, and a mix of themed dining rooms.

16
00:01:23,092 --> 00:01:29,870
Guests also get access to the specialty restaurants at the sister resort, Bahia Principe Explore Turquesa.

17
00:01:29,921 --> 00:01:35,877
Between meals, grab a snack at The Truck or a drink at a thatched pool bar.

18
00:01:35,927 --> 00:01:37,467
Need a day to slow down?

19
00:01:37,516 --> 00:01:43,862
The spa offers massages, body scrubs, and manicures, and reviewers praise the massages.

20
00:01:43,912 --> 00:01:48,848
The gym is complete, with weights, bikes, and fitness and yoga classes.

21
00:01:48,898 --> 00:01:56,891
For action, kayaking, snorkeling, windsurfing, tennis, soccer, and beach volleyball are all included.

22
00:01:56,942 --> 00:02:03,978
After dark, there are evening shows, dancing, a nightclub, and a casino in Bahia Principe Village.

23
00:02:04,028 --> 00:02:06,307
A few tips to get the most out of it.

24
00:02:06,356 --> 00:02:14,872
Some reviewers found the food hit or miss, with long lines at peak times, so go early and ask the front desk about the specialty restaurants.

25
00:02:14,922 --> 00:02:25,912
Renovation work was scheduled from April tenth to November thirtieth, twenty twenty-six, covering three hundred fifty-eight rooms in ten villas, so ask which villa your room is in.

26
00:02:25,963 --> 00:02:31,239
The airport is about twenty-five kilometers away, so plan your transfer ahead.

27
00:02:31,289 --> 00:02:33,243
So, is it worth it?

28
00:02:33,293 --> 00:02:42,674
Expedia guests give it seven point six out of ten, across one thousand seven hundred forty-two verified reviews, with cleanliness and amenities both at eight.

29
00:02:42,724 --> 00:02:51,982
My honest score is seven point five out of ten: a big, lively resort with great pools, best for an active, social, all-inclusive week.

30
00:02:52,031 --> 00:02:55,188
The link to book it is in the description.
